## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design end-to-end RAG pipelines with governance in a realistic Azure stack.

## Key Concepts
- Retrieval augmented generation, vector search, API Management, per-tenant residency, secret redaction, monitoring.
- Access controls, cost vs latency trade-offs, data provenance.

## Code Example
```javascript
// Redact secrets from user prompt
function redactPrompt(input){
  return input.replace(/(password|token|secret)\s*=\s*\S+/gi, '$1=REDACTED');
}
```

```javascript
// Simple guardrail stub: block disallowed topics in response
function guardResponse(text){
  const forbidden=[/internal-credential|secret-key/i];
  for(const f of forbidden){
    if(f.test(text)) return text.replace(f, 'REDACTED');
  }
  return text;
}
```

